{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2021-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1631750400, "end_date": 1632355199, "month_true_total": 151, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:50:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "99711571", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163732964", "personaname": "Vinerock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163732964/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 9345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8701, "last_played": 1677132619, "avatar": "6796cf53d1b12f7e70b34f2d02f69a41e1de3d81"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good", "timestamp_created": 1632188390, "timestamp_updated": 1632188390, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99708009", "author": {"steamid": "76561198366596091", "personaname": "Ace098", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198366596091/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 506, "last_played": 1661620263, "avatar": "9129523a03a1f6373397551271aa555d41a9091d"}, "language": "english", "review": "You don't play the game for a serious story. You play the game for massive bug shooting and silly in game dialogue that's so bad it's good. One of the games that's better with more friends.", "timestamp_created": 1632181898, "timestamp_updated": 1632181898, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99702004", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036569305", "personaname": "Slepnirson", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Slepnirson/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 715, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 638, "last_played": 1632259617, "avatar": "c2d0377ac81178c2630f9a82cdbbfffe4256cd59"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a pretty entertaining game once you turn off NPC voice lines, if that option wasn't available I probably would have returned the game immediately as they are such irritatingly stupid lines. Think cheesiest idiot character from really crappy movies, only EVERY SINGLE NPC. \nIf you're new to the series, there isn't a ton of variety to the missions, or the different iterations of the games, to be honest. You run around, shooting giant bugs (which the NPCs can't recognize as insects) and spaceships and vaguely animalistic bipeds (which the dumb-a-f NPCs call \"humanoid monsters/aliens\" or some junk). You have to collect and upgrade weapons, your armor, and gather health drops from the dead enemies, and the game has a lot of replayability as a result of the extensive lists of unlockable weapons (which must be upgraded by picking up duplicates) and the multiple classes and difficulties.\nBut again, the voice lines of the first half of the first story mission prompted this (admittedly angry) review, because I have to get directions from a NPC. \nTLDR; Good game for multiplayer especially (unless you really like the solo grind), but save your sanity by muting the NPCs.", "timestamp_created": 1632171128, "timestamp_updated": 1632171128, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_r